# The SAME beer bottle the shadow scenes use — identical PROTO and fields to
# worlds/hallway_and_beta_empty.wbt:1370 and webots-kinova/worlds/shadow_arm.wbt:78
# (BeerBottle, name "bottle", mass 0.4). NOT the blue WaterBottleOpaque cylinder from
# arm_base.wbt, which is a different object.
#
# The PROTO is fetched from the Webots GitHub tree, as every other PROTO in this repo's worlds
# is: this Webots install ships NO local proto library (projects/objects/drinks/ holds only a
# webots.yaml stub; the one .proto on disk is Mavic2Pro), so a local path would not resolve.
#
# Placed on the "RoundTable" Solid at (-6.68445, 1.87241): its top face is the Pose at z=0.725
# carrying a Cylinder of height 0.03, so the surface is at 0.725 + 0.015 = 0.740. BeerBottle is
# BOTTOM-CENTRED, hence z = 0.74 exactly — the same value both reference worlds use to stand it
# on a 0.74 m table. Offset ~9 cm off the table centre on purpose: dead-centre placement lets a
# fit that has not actually localised the bottle still look correct, which is the last thing a
# test should allow.
DEF bottle BeerBottle {
  translation -6.60445 1.83241 0.74
  name "bottle"
  mass 0.4
}
